<title>USA: Tellabs to supply echo canceller.</title>
<headline>Tellabs to supply echo canceller.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tellabs Inc said Monday it will supply its 2551CVX T1 echo canceller for the digital cellular systems of Atlanta-based BellSouth Cellular Corp and its service area of more than 200 cities in 15 states.</p>
<p>Terms of the contract were not disclosed.</p>
<p>BellSouth Cellular is part of BellSouth Corp.</p>
<p>The 2551CVX T1 echo canceller helps cellular service providers ensure echo-free service on both mobile-to-mobile and mobile-to-land telephone calls.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
